      {
       "data": "Solve::svars: Equations may not give solutions for all \"solve\" variables.",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      },
      {
       "data": "{\n\t\"name\": \"WolframKernelMessage\",\n\t\"message\": \"Solve::svars: Equations may not give solutions for all \\\"solve\\\" variables.\",\n\t\"stack\": \"\"\n}",
       "mime": "application/vnd.code.notebook.error"
      }
     ],
     "id": "3ec42168-9db9-4f61-a527-213ea374077a"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* the product points. Raw Solve components are redundant (overlapping parametrizations); classify each by its factors: site-1 factor f1 = column, site-2 factor f2 = row of Φ(c) (free parameters set to 1; c-entries of the dropped zero shapes reported as 0). A component is the localizing span if its site-2 factor is Ω1 (parallel), otherwise a nontrivial isolated point. *)\nω2 = βbasis[[2]];\nfactorsOf[sol_] := Module[{cc, free, M, rowi, colj}, cc = cs /. sol; free = Variables[cc]; cc = cc /. Thread[free -> 1];\n   M = Sum[cc[[k]] allMats[[k]], {k, Length[allMats]}];\n   If[Union[Flatten[M]] === {0}, {\"zero\"}, rowi = First[FirstPosition[Total[Abs[M], {2}], _?(# != 0 &)]]; colj = First[FirstPosition[Total[Abs[M], {1}], _?(# != 0 &)]];\n    {ReplacePart[cc, Thread[Complement[Range[Length[allMats]], liveIdx] -> 0]], M[[All, colj]]/M[[rowi, colj]], M[[rowi, All]]/M[[rowi, colj]]}]];\nptAll = DeleteCases[factorsOf /@ solProd, {\"zero\"}];\nptLoc = Select[ptAll, MatrixRank[{#[[3]], Ω1}] == 1 &];\nptNon = DeleteDuplicates[Select[ptAll, MatrixRank[{#[[3]], Ω1}] > 1 &], MatrixRank[{#1[[2]], #2[[2]]}] == 1 && MatrixRank[{#1[[3]], #2[[3]]}] == 1 &];\nchecks[\"# components localizing (site-2 factor Ω1), # distinct nontrivial points\"] = {Length[ptLoc], Length[ptNon]};\n{cP, f1P, f2P} = ptNon[[1]];\nκΩ[f2_] := Module[{s = LinearSolve[Transpose[{Ω1, ω2}], f2]}, s[[2]]/s[[1]]];\nchecks[\"nontrivial point: c on (1,T10,T11,T20,T21,T22,T30,T31,T32,T33)\"] = cP/cP[[4]];\nchecks[\"nontrivial point: rotRank (site 1, site 2)\"] = {rotRank[f1P], rotRank[f2P]};\n(* is the product locus otherwise continuous? the localizing components all have c(T10) = c(T20) = c(T30) = 0 (site-2 factor Ω1); the nontrivial points are isolated *)\nchecks[\"localizing components: c(T10), c(T20), c(T30)\"] = Union[ptLoc[[All, 1]][[All, {2, 4, 7}]]];\nchecks[\"site-2 factor of the point: in span{Ω1, ω2}? kappa\"] = {MatrixRank[{f2P, Ω1, ω2}] == 2, κΩ[f2P]};\nGrid[{{\"# raw components / localizing / distinct nontrivial points\", {Length[solProd], Length[ptLoc], Length[ptNon]}}, {\"c of the nontrivial point, normalized c(T20) = 1\", cP/cP[[4]]}, {\"rotRank (site 1, site 2) of the point (4 = rotation)\", {rotRank[f1P], rotRank[f2P]}}, {\"c(T10), c(T20), c(T30) on the localizing components\", Union[ptLoc[[All, 1]][[All, {2, 4, 7}]]]}, {\"site-2 factor in span{Ω1, ω2}; κ\", {MatrixRank[{f2P, Ω1, ω2}] == 2, κΩ[f2P]}}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
