  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* the pipeline for explicit (h, θ, z, w): rebuild the vacuum and the nine T_λ(θ1-3h) with fresh definitions (no shared memo), redo the exact product locus (shapes with vanishing <Ω|T dropped), and for every nontrivial point (site-2 factor not Ω1) record the actual site covectors f1, f2, the torus invariants y of both factors (w1 fixed), rotRank, whether f1 = e1.R(w1,y-star).ρ(Dy[w2]) exactly, the decomposition of f2 in span{e1 R, e1 X R} for X = E12, E23, E13 (R = Rrot(z,(w1,y-star)), no torus factor; 'no' = f2 not in that span), and the c-vector. y-star = w2(θ12-h)/(θ12-3h). *)\npipeline320[zz_, ww_, hh_, th_] := Module[{lax1x, lax2x, twR, mono2x, tqx, tL2x, cbrx, TL2x, Zdx, v0x, Ω1x, Ω2x, mats, β, Ac, cv, idxs, eqs, sol, out, solveVacX, DyX, ystar, Rst, th12},\n  lax1x[s_, x_] := Table[KroneckerDelta[i, j] (x - th[[s]]) id1 + hh Ee[i, j], {i, 3}, {j, 3}];\n  lax2x[x_] := lax2x[x] = With[{L1 = lax1x[1, x], L2 = lax1x[2, x]}, Table[Sum[KroneckerProduct[L1[[i, k]], L2[[k, j]]], {k, 3}], {i, 3}, {j, 3}]];\n  twR[T_, M_] := Table[Sum[T[[i, l]] M[[l, j]], {l, 3}], {i, 3}, {j, 3}];\n  mono2x[M_][x_] := mono2x[M][x] = twR[lax2x[x], M];\n  tqx[mono_, a_, x_] := Sum[Sum[Signature[σ] Dot @@ Table[mono[x - (k - 1) hh][[σ[[k]], rows[[k]]]], {k, a}], {σ, Permutations[rows]}], {rows, Subsets[Range[3], {a}]}];\n  tL2x[a_, x_, M_] := tL2x[a, x, M] = tqx[mono2x[M], a, x];\n  cbrx[tf_, λ_, x_, idm_] := With[{lc = conj[λ], n = Max[λ]}, Sum[With[{as = Table[lc[[σ[[i]]]] + i - σ[[i]], {i, n}]}, If[Min[as] < 0 || Max[as] > 3, 0, Signature[σ] Dot @@ Table[If[as[[i]] == 0, idm, tf[as[[i]], x + (i - 1) hh]], {i, n}]]], {σ, Permutations[Range[n]]}]];\n  TL2x[λ_, x_, M_] := cbrx[tL2x[#1, #2, M] &, λ, x, id2];\n  Zdx = DiagonalMatrix[zz]; v0x = th[[1]] - Λ[[1]] hh; th12 = th[[1]] - th[[2]];\n  Ω1x = Om1[zz, ww]; Ω2x = kron[Ω1x, Ω1x];\n  mats = Join[{Partition[Ω2x, d1]}, Table[Partition[Normal[Ω2x . TL2x[λ, v0x, Zdx]], d1], {λ, shapes}]];\n  idxs = Select[Range[Length[mats]], Union[Flatten[mats[[#]]]] =!= {0} &];\n  β = Module[{b = {Ω1x}}, Do[If[MatrixRank[Append[b, row]] > Length[b], AppendTo[b, row/row[[Ordering[Abs[row], -1][[1]]]]]], {row, Flatten[mats[[idxs]], 1]}]; b];\n  Ac = Table[Transpose[Table[LinearSolve[Transpose[β], M[[i]]], {i, d1}]], {M, mats[[idxs]]}];\n  cv = Array[cc, Length[idxs]]; eqs = DeleteCases[Union[Flatten[Minors[Sum[cv[[k]] Ac[[k]], {k, Length[idxs]}], 2]]], 0];\n  sol = DeleteDuplicates[Quiet[Solve[eqs == 0, cv]]];\n  solveVacX[g_] := Module[{s}, s = Select[Quiet[Solve[Thread[(Om1[zz, {ww[[1]], yv, 1}] . ρdiag[{d1v, d2v, 1}]) == sv g], {yv, d1v, d2v, sv}]], (sv /. #) =!= 0 &]; If[s === {}, \"none\", {yv, d1v, d2v} /. s]];\n  DyX = Table[1/(ww[[2]] - zz[[i]]), {i, 3}]; ystar = ww[[2]] (th12 - hh)/(th12 - 3 hh); Rst = Normal[Rrot[zz, {ww[[1]], ystar, 1}]];\n  out = Table[Module[{c1 = cv /. s, free, M, rowi, colj, f1, f2, ab}, free = Variables[c1]; c1 = c1 /. Thread[free -> 1]; M = Sum[c1[[k]] mats[[idxs[[k]]]], {k, Length[idxs]}];\n     If[Union[Flatten[M]] === {0}, Nothing, rowi = First[FirstPosition[Total[Abs[M], {2}], _?(# != 0 &)]]; colj = First[FirstPosition[Total[Abs[M], {1}], _?(# != 0 &)]]; f1 = M[[All, colj]]; f2 = M[[rowi, All]];\n      If[MatrixRank[{f2, Ω1x}] == 1, Nothing,\n       ab = Table[With[{u = Normal[e1 . Rst], v = Normal[e1 . Ee @@ x . Rst]}, If[MatrixRank[{u, v, f2}] == 2, LinearSolve[Transpose[{u, v}], f2], \"no\"]], {x, {{1, 2}, {2, 3}, {1, 3}}}];\n       <|\"f1\" -> f1, \"f2\" -> f2, \"y1\" -> solveVacX[f1], \"y2\" -> solveVacX[f2], \"rotRank\" -> {rotRank[f1], rotRank[f2]}, \"f1 = e1 R(w1,y-star) rho(Delta_w2)\" -> (MatrixRank[{f1, Normal[e1 . Rst . ρdiag[DyX]]}] == 1), \"dress E12,E23,E13\" -> ab, \"c\" -> ReplacePart[ConstantArray[0, Length[mats]], Thread[idxs -> c1]]|>]]], {s, sol}];\n  <|\"site-2 span dim\" -> Length[β], \"# solution components\" -> Length[sol], \"ystar\" -> ystar, \"points\" -> out|>];\n{tP1, runP1} = AbsoluteTiming[pipeline320[zN, wN, hN, thN]];\nu15pt1 = runP1[\"points\"][[1]];\nchecks[\"pipeline320 at P1: # nontrivial points, y1, rotRank, f1 = e1 R rho(Dy[w2]), dressing\"] = {Length[runP1[\"points\"]], u15pt1[\"y1\"], u15pt1[\"rotRank\"], u15pt1[\"f1 = e1 R(w1,y-star) rho(Delta_w2)\"], u15pt1[\"dress E12,E23,E13\"]};\nGrid[{{\"time (s)\", tP1}, {\"site-2 span dim, # Solve components, y-star\", {runP1[\"site-2 span dim\"], runP1[\"# solution components\"], runP1[\"ystar\"]}}, {\"# nontrivial points\", Length[runP1[\"points\"]]}, {\"y1 = {y, d1, d2} (site 1), y2 (site 2)\", {u15pt1[\"y1\"], u15pt1[\"y2\"]}}, {\"rotRank (site 1, site 2)\", u15pt1[\"rotRank\"]}, {\"f1 = e1 R(w1,y-star) ρ(Dy[w2]) exactly (parallel)?\", u15pt1[\"f1 = e1 R(w1,y-star) rho(Delta_w2)\"]}, {\"f2 in span{e1 R, e1 X R}: coefficients for X = E12, E23, E13\", u15pt1[\"dress E12,E23,E13\"]}, {\"c on (1,T10,T11,T20,T21,T22,T30,T31,T32,T33)\", u15pt1[\"c\"]/u15pt1[\"c\"][[4]]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
