   "value": "(* the undo. Site 1 is f1 = e1.R.ρ(Δ) with R = ρ(n), n = the N+ Gauss element of Ω_{(w1,y-star)} (same r_k as the adjoint: rep independent), Δ = diag(1/(w2-z)); site 2 is f2 = e1.(1 + b E23).ρ(n). Since ρ(Δ) normalizes N+, e1.ρ(n).ρ(Δ) = Δ^Λ e1.ρ(n') with n' = Δ^-1 n Δ in N+: site 1 is exactly s e1.ρ(n'). ρ(n')⊗ρ(n') fixes every HW ket, so <f1 x f2|HW> = s <e1 x φ|HW> with φ = f2.ρ(n')^-1 (the undone covector sits at site 2; by the flip symmetry of V x V this is the spec's <φ x e1|HW> with the sites renamed). The Gauss exponents of a 3x3 upper unipotent matrix are r1 = n12, r2 = n13 - n12 n23, r3 = n23. HW kets = joint null space of the total raising generators per weight sector (first find which E_ij annihilate the ket e1 in this convention). *)\nu15r[w2c_] := rOm[zN, {u15w1, u15ystar[w2c], u15w3}];\nu15rhoOf[r_] := MatrixExp[r[[1]] Normal[Ee[1, 2]]] . MatrixExp[r[[2]] Normal[Ee[1, 3]]] . MatrixExp[r[[3]] Normal[Ee[2, 3]]];\nu15n3[r_] := {{1, r[[1]], r[[2]] + r[[1]] r[[3]]}, {0, 1, r[[3]]}, {0, 0, 1}};\nu15rFrom3[n_] := {n[[1, 2]], n[[1, 3]] - n[[1, 2]] n[[2, 3]], n[[2, 3]]};\nu15np[w2c_] := With[{n = u15n3[u15r[w2c]], D = DiagonalMatrix[Dy[w2c]]}, Inverse[D] . n . D];\nu15rhoN[w2c_] := u15rhoOf[u15r[w2c]]; u15rhoNp[w2c_] := u15rhoOf[u15rFrom3[u15np[w2c]]];\nu15v1[w2c_] := Normal[e1 . u15rhoNp[w2c]];   (* = f1 up to a scalar *)\nu15v2[w2c_, bt_] := Normal[(e1 + bt e1 . Ee[2, 3]) . u15rhoN[w2c]];   (* = f2 up to a scalar for bt = beta/alpha *)\nu15phi[w2c_, bt_] := u15v2[w2c, bt] . Inverse[u15rhoNp[w2c]];\nchecks[\"u15 y-star never a z_k or w2 (Dy finite)\"] = And @@ Table[FreeQ[zN, u15ystar[w2c]] && u15ystar[w2c] =!= w2c, {w2c, u15w2s}];\nchecks[\"u15 site 1: f1 parallel to e1.rho(n'), site 2: f2 parallel to (e1 + b e1.E23).rho(n), all w2\"] = Table[{MatrixRank[{u15f1[w2c], u15v1[w2c]}] == 1, MatrixRank[{u15f2[w2c], u15v2[w2c, u15bt[w2c]]}] == 1}, {w2c, u15w2s}];\nu15ketAnn = {Norm[Normal[Ee[1, 2] . e1]], Norm[Normal[Ee[2, 1] . e1]], Norm[Normal[Ee[2, 3] . e1]], Norm[Normal[Ee[3, 2] . e1]]};\nu15raise = If[u15ketAnn[[1]] == 0 && u15ketAnn[[3]] == 0, {{1, 2}, {2, 3}}, {{2, 1}, {3, 2}}];\nu15Etot = Normal[(E1 @@ # + E2 @@ #)] & /@ u15raise;\nu15sectors = Union[wtBasis];\nu15HWlist = Flatten[Table[Module[{idx = secOf[μ], A, ns}, A = Join @@ (#[[All, idx]] & /@ u15Etot); ns = NullSpace[A]; Table[<|\"wt\" -> μ, \"vec\" -> ReplacePart[ConstantArray[0, d2], Thread[idx -> n]]|>, {n, ns}]], {μ, u15sectors}], 1];\nu15HW = Transpose[u15HWlist[[All, \"vec\"]]]; u15HWwt = u15HWlist[[All, \"wt\"]];\nu15Tally = Tally[u15HWwt];\nchecks[\"u15 HW weights/multiplicities (expect [3,2,0]^2 = 10 states)\"] = u15Tally;\nchecks[\"u15 number of HW kets\"] = Length[u15HWlist];\nchecks[\"u15 HW kets killed by total raising\"] = And @@ Table[Norm[Flatten[Normal[(E1 @@ r + E2 @@ r) . u15HW]]] == 0, {r, u15raise}];\nchecks[\"u15 (rho(n') x rho(n')).HW == HW (two w2)\"] = Table[With[{R = u15rhoNp[w2c]}, KroneckerProduct[R, R] . u15HW == u15HW], {w2c, {7/3, -1/2}}];\nchecks[\"u15 <v1 x v2|HW> == <e1 x phi|HW> (all w2, all HW)\"] = Table[kron[u15v1[w2c], u15v2[w2c, u15bt[w2c]]] . u15HW == kron[e1, u15phi[w2c, u15bt[w2c]]] . u15HW, {w2c, u15w2s}];\nGrid[{{\"ket e1 annihilated by (norms of E12.e1, E21.e1, E23.e1, E32.e1)\", u15ketAnn}, {\"raising pairs used\", u15raise}, {\"# HW kets\", Length[u15HWlist]}, {\"HW weights {wt, mult}\", Column[u15Tally]}, {\"HW killed by total raising\", checks[\"u15 HW kets killed by total raising\"]}, {\"site factors reproduced (f1 ∥ e1.ρ(n'), f2 ∥ (e1+b e1.E23).ρ(n))\", checks[\"u15 site 1: f1 parallel to e1.rho(n'), site 2: f2 parallel to (e1 + b e1.E23).rho(n), all w2\"]}, {\"(ρ(n')⊗ρ(n')).HW == HW  (w2 = 7/3, -1/2)\", checks[\"u15 (rho(n') x rho(n')).HW == HW (two w2)\"]}, {\"<v1⊗v2|HW> == <e1⊗φ|HW>\", checks[\"u15 <v1 x v2|HW> == <e1 x phi|HW> (all w2, all HW)\"]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
