  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* per-weight ranks of the undone covectors phi(w2_i) over the six w2: (a) the actual point (dressing beta/alpha along E23, resolvent Dy[w2]); (b) beta = 0 (rotation part only); (c) control, resolvent point = the vacuum parameter y-star (n' built with Dy[y-star]; this is the 'paper-like' assignment, Delta-hat^-1 n Delta-hat with b'' - a'' c'' = 0), with beta; (c0) the same with beta = 0 (the pure old blind-spot control). 'identically vanishing' = zero at all six sample points. Position uses Heads -> False (the default would test the head List). *)\nu15npc[w2c_] := With[{n = u15n3[u15r[w2c]], D = DiagonalMatrix[Dy[u15ystar[w2c]]]}, Inverse[D] . n . D];\nu15rhoNpc[w2c_] := u15rhoOf[u15rFrom3[u15npc[w2c]]];\nu15phiC[w2c_, bt_] := u15v2[w2c, bt] . Inverse[u15rhoNpc[w2c]];\nu15wts = Table[Table[J0[k][p], {k, 3}], {p, ps[{Λ}]}]; u15wtList = Union[u15wts]; u15idx = Association[Table[μ -> Flatten[Position[u15wts, μ, {1}, Heads -> False]], {μ, u15wtList}]];\nu15variant[t_] := Table[Switch[t, \"a\", u15phi[w2c, u15bt[w2c]], \"b\", u15phi[w2c, 0], \"c\", u15phiC[w2c, u15bt[w2c]], \"c0\", u15phiC[w2c, 0]], {w2c, u15w2s}];\nu15Phi = Association[Table[t -> u15variant[t], {t, {\"a\", \"b\", \"c\", \"c0\"}}]];\nu15rankTab[t_] := Table[With[{M = u15Phi[t][[All, u15idx[μ]]]}, {μ, Length[u15idx[μ]], MatrixRank[M], Flatten[Position[Transpose[M], _?(Union[#] === {0} &), {1}, Heads -> False]] // Map[u15idx[μ][[#]] &]}], {μ, u15wtList}];\nu15ranks = Association[Table[t -> u15rankTab[t], {t, {\"a\", \"b\", \"c\", \"c0\"}}]];\nu15ra = u15ranks[\"a\"];\nchecks[\"u15 # distinct weights of [3,2,0]\"] = Length[u15wtList];\nchecks[\"u15 per-weight ranks (b): all = dim V_mu\"] = And @@ (#[[2]] == #[[3]] & /@ u15ranks[\"b\"]);\nchecks[\"u15 total phi-span rank (a),(b),(c),(c0) out of 15\"] = Table[MatrixRank[u15Phi[t]], {t, {\"a\", \"b\", \"c\", \"c0\"}}];\nu15vanWts[t_] := Select[u15ranks[t], #[[4]] =!= {} &][[All, {1, 4}]];\nGrid[Join[{{\"weight μ\", \"dim V_μ\", \"rank (a) point\", \"rank (b) beta=0\", \"rank (c) resolvent y-star, beta\", \"rank (c0) resolvent y-star, beta=0\"}}, Table[{u15ranks[\"a\"][[k, 1]], u15ranks[\"a\"][[k, 2]], u15ranks[\"a\"][[k, 3]], u15ranks[\"b\"][[k, 3]], u15ranks[\"c\"][[k, 3]], u15ranks[\"c0\"][[k, 3]]}, {k, Length[u15wtList]}], {{\"identically vanishing basis indices\", \"\", \"(a) \" <> ToString[u15vanWts[\"a\"]], \"(b) \" <> ToString[u15vanWts[\"b\"]], \"(c) \" <> ToString[u15vanWts[\"c\"]], \"(c0) \" <> ToString[u15vanWts[\"c0\"]]}, {\"total rank in V (15)\", \"\", Sequence @@ checks[\"u15 total phi-span rank (a),(b),(c),(c0) out of 15\"][[1 ;; 4]]}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
