  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* torus completion, step 2 of 2: the other six random w2, then the torus-completed HW counts. Rows <f1 ρ(D) x f2 ρ(D)|HW_nu> with the ACTUAL pipeline covectors (a), and rebuilt from the formulas for (b) beta = 0, (c) resolvent y-star with beta, (c0) resolvent y-star with beta = 0 (the rotation part of f1 and f2 both with Dy[y-star] in f1). The torus acts as the character prod D_i^nu_i on each HW overlap, so a torus-completed row set sees every irrep independently. *)\n{u15tR2, u15rndRuns2} = AbsoluteTiming[Association[Table[c0 -> pipeline320[zN, {u15w1, c0, u15w3}, hN, thN], {c0, u15rndW2[[7 ;; 12]]}]]];\nu15rndRuns = Join[u15rndRuns1, u15rndRuns2];\nu15rndB = Association[Table[c0 -> u15rndRuns[c0][\"points\"][[1]], {c0, u15rndW2}]];\nu15rndBeta = Association[Table[c0 -> With[{a = u15rndB[c0][\"dress E12,E23,E13\"][[2]]}, a[[2]]/a[[1]]], {c0, u15rndW2}]];\nchecks[\"u15 torus: exactly one nontrivial point for all 12 random w2; y1 == y-star\"] = {Table[Length[u15rndRuns[c0][\"points\"]], {c0, u15rndW2}], And @@ Table[u15rndB[c0][\"y1\"][[1, 1]] == u15ystar[c0], {c0, u15rndW2}]};\nu15torusRow[c0_, D_, t_] := Module[{rD = ρdiag[D], f1, f2}, {f1, f2} = Switch[t, \"a\", {Normal[u15rndB[c0][\"f1\"]], Normal[u15rndB[c0][\"f2\"]]}, \"b\", {u15v1[c0], u15v2[c0, 0]}, \"c0\", {Normal[e1 . u15rhoN[c0] . ρdiag[Dy[u15ystar[c0]]]], u15v2[c0, 0]}, \"c\", {Normal[e1 . u15rhoN[c0] . ρdiag[Dy[u15ystar[c0]]]], u15v2[c0, u15rndBeta[c0]]}]; kron[f1 . rD, f2 . rD] . u15HW];\nu15MT = Association[Table[t -> Table[u15torusRow[u15rndW2[[i]], u15rndD[[i]], t], {i, 12}], {t, {\"a\", \"b\", \"c\", \"c0\"}}]];\nu15hwTor = Association[Table[t -> {MatrixRank[u15MT[t]], u15perIrrep[u15MT[t]]}, {t, {\"a\", \"b\", \"c\", \"c0\"}}]];\nu15fix12 = Table[kron[Normal[u15rndB[c0][\"f1\"]], Normal[u15rndB[c0][\"f2\"]]] . u15HW, {c0, u15rndW2}];\nchecks[\"u15 HW rank torus-completed (a), (b), (c), (c0)\"] = (u15hwTor[#][[1]] & /@ {\"a\", \"b\", \"c\", \"c0\"});\nchecks[\"u15 HW rank fixed torus, 12 random w2 (a)\"] = MatrixRank[u15fix12];\nu15rowTab[h_] := Table[{h[[2, k, 1]], h[[2, k, 2]], h[[2, k, 3]], h[[2, k, 4]]}, {k, Length[u15irreps]}];\nGrid[{{\"HW rank torus-completed (12 random (w2,D)): (a), (b), (c), (c0)\", checks[\"u15 HW rank torus-completed (a), (b), (c), (c0)\"]}, {\"HW rank fixed torus D = 1, 12 random w2 (a)\", checks[\"u15 HW rank fixed torus, 12 random w2 (a)\"]}, {\"per irrep {irrep, mult, rank, nonzero}: (a) torus-completed\", Column[u15rowTab[u15hwTor[\"a\"]]]}, {\"(c0) torus-completed\", Column[u15rowTab[u15hwTor[\"c0\"]]]}, {\"time (s)\", u15tR2}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
