  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* 3x3 closed form for the undone element n'' = n n'^-1 = n Δ^-1 n^-1 Δ (upper unipotent; Gauss exponents r1'' = a'', r3'' = c'', r2'' = b'' - a'' c''). Claim, with W = w2 and Y = y-star independent symbols: (b'' - a'' c'')/(a'' c'') = (W - Y)/(Y - z2), w1-independent: the E13 Gauss exponent vanishes iff W = Y (the 'paper-like' resolvent assignment, controls c/c0 above) and is non-constant in Y. Verified with symbolic Y, W, w1 for rational z and for symbolic z. Then an empirical rational fit of beta/alpha(w2) through all 18 data points (six w2 + twelve random). *)\nClear[u15z1, u15z2, u15z3, u15Y, u15W, u15w1s];\nu15check3b[zv_, w1v_, yv_, w2v_] := Module[{r = rOm[zv, {w1v, yv, 1}], n, Δ, npp, ap, bp, cp}, n = {{1, r[[1]], r[[2]] + r[[1]] r[[3]]}, {0, 1, r[[3]]}, {0, 0, 1}}; Δ = DiagonalMatrix[1/(w2v - zv)]; npp = Simplify[n . Inverse[Δ] . Inverse[n] . Δ]; {ap, bp, cp} = {npp[[1, 2]], npp[[1, 3]], npp[[2, 3]]}; {Simplify[(bp - ap cp)/(ap cp) - (w2v - yv)/(yv - zv[[2]])], npp[[2, 1]] == 0 && npp[[3, 1]] == 0 && npp[[3, 2]] == 0 && npp[[1, 1]] == 1, Simplify[(bp - ap cp) /. w2v -> yv], Simplify[bp/(ap cp)]}];\n{u15t3a, u15id1} = AbsoluteTiming[u15check3b[zN, u15w1s, u15Y, u15W]];\n{u15t3b, u15id2} = AbsoluteTiming[u15check3b[{u15z1, u15z2, u15z3}, u15w1s, u15Y, u15W]];\nchecks[\"u15 3x3 identity (b''-a''c'')/(a''c'') = (w2-y-star)/(y-star-z2), symbolic y-star, w2, w1; rational z\"] = u15id1[[1 ;; 3]];\nchecks[\"u15 3x3 identity, fully symbolic z\"] = u15id2[[1 ;; 3]];\nu15data = Join[Table[{c0, u15bt[c0]}, {c0, u15w2s}], Table[{c0, u15rndBeta[c0]}, {c0, u15rndW2}]];\nu15fitRat[dp_, dq_] := Module[{a, b, vars, eqs}, vars = Join[Array[a, dp + 1, 0], Array[b, dq + 1, 0]]; eqs = Table[Sum[a[i] xx^i, {i, 0, dp}] - yy Sum[b[i] xx^i, {i, 0, dq}] /. {xx -> p[[1]], yy -> p[[2]]}, {p, u15data}]; NullSpace[Normal[CoefficientArrays[eqs, vars][[2]]]]];\nu15ns = u15fitRat[1, 2];\nu15fit = Factor[(u15ns[[1, 1]] + u15ns[[1, 2]] xx)/(u15ns[[1, 3]] + u15ns[[1, 4]] xx + u15ns[[1, 5]] xx^2)];\nchecks[\"u15 beta/alpha(w2): exact rational fit (deg 1)/(deg 2) through 18 points, # null vectors\"] = {Length[u15ns], u15fit};\nchecks[\"u15 beta/alpha(w2) = (6125/5676) w2/((w2-z3)(y-star-z3)) at P1 (w1 = 5/2)\"] = And @@ (((6125/5676) #[[1]]/((#[[1]] - zN[[3]]) (u15ystar[#[[1]]] - zN[[3]])) == #[[2]]) & /@ u15data);\nGrid[{{\"3x3: (b''-a''c'')/(a''c'') - (w2-y-star)/(y-star-z2): rational z, symbolic Y, W, w1\", u15id1[[1]], \"n'' upper unipotent?\", u15id1[[2]]}, {\"same, symbolic z\", u15id2[[1]], \"\", u15id2[[2]]}, {\"b'' - a'' c'' with W -> Y (control)\", u15id1[[3]], \"\", \"\"}, {\"b''/(a''c'')\", u15id1[[4]], \"\", \"\"}, {\"beta/alpha fit (deg 1)/(deg 2) through 18 points\", u15fit, \"# null vectors\", Length[u15ns]}, {\"beta/alpha = (6125/5676) w2/((w2-z3)(y-star-z3)), all 18 points?\", checks[\"u15 beta/alpha(w2) = (6125/5676) w2/((w2-z3)(y-star-z3)) at P1 (w1 = 5/2)\"], \"\", \"\"}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
