  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* per-irrep verdict: 'fully determined' = rank of phi equals the dimension of the site-2 weight space that carries the CG coefficients of that irrep (HW frame: nu - Lambda; LW frame: Reverse[nu] - (0,2,3)); plus the torus-completed HW rank per irrep. The union over point families is this one family: the point of the Solve with T22, T32, T33 vanishing on <Omega| has no analogue of the [3,1,0] point A (whose shapes (2,2), (3,2) are exactly the vanishing ones here). *)\nu15verdictTab = Table[Module[{ν = u15irreps[[k]]}, {ν, u15verdictHW[[k, 2]], u15verdictHW[[k, 3]], u15verdictHW[[k, 4]], u15verdictHW[[k, 5]], u16verdict[[k, 3]], u16verdict[[k, 4]], u16verdict[[k, 5]], u15verdictHW[[k, 5]] || u16verdict[[k, 5]], u15hwTor[\"a\"][[2, k, 3]]}], {k, Length[u15irreps]}];\nchecks[\"u15 per-irrep verdict {nu, mult, HW wt, HW {dim,rank}, HW determined, LW wt, LW {dim,rank}, LW determined, either, torus rank}\"] = u15verdictTab;\nchecks[\"u15 # irreps fully determined: HW frame, LW frame, either\"] = {Count[u15verdictTab[[All, 5]], True], Count[u15verdictTab[[All, 8]], True], Count[u15verdictTab[[All, 9]], True]};\nGrid[Join[{{\"irrep ν\", \"mult\", \"site-2 wt ν-Λ (HW)\", \"HW {dim, rank}\", \"HW determined\", \"site-2 wt (LW)\", \"LW {dim, rank}\", \"LW determined\", \"either\", \"torus-completed rank (a)\"}}, u15verdictTab, {{\"# determined: HW, LW, either\", \"\", \"\", \"\", checks[\"u15 # irreps fully determined: HW frame, LW frame, either\"][[1]], \"\", \"\", checks[\"u15 # irreps fully determined: HW frame, LW frame, either\"][[2]], checks[\"u15 # irreps fully determined: HW frame, LW frame, either\"][[3]], \"\"}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
