   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* span S2 = identity + every non-zero operator of rank <= 2 in the scan, and its joint site-1 span. Work with Mt = Transpose[Partition[...]] (rows = site-2 index, row vectors = site-1 covectors), so the machinery of cells 6-7 applies verbatim: beta = basis of the joint site-1 span (Omega1 first, then greedily rows of the non-local Mt), Phi(c) = sum_j (site-2 vector a_j(c)) x beta_j is a product iff the r vectors a_j(c) are parallel (2x2 minors of the 15 x r matrix). *)\nu17ops = Join[{{\"1\", None}}, Select[u17tab, 1 <= #[[3]] <= 2 &][[All, {1, 2}]] /. {m_, λ_} :> {\"T\" <> ToString[λ] <> \"@θ2\" <> If[m >= 0, \"+\", \"\"] <> ToString[m] <> \"h\", {λ, m}}];\nu17mats = Join[{Transpose[Partition[Ω2, d1]]}, Table[Transpose[u17M @@ op[[2]]], {op, Rest[u17ops]}]];\nu17opNames = u17ops[[All, 1]];\nu17beta = Module[{b = {Ω1}}, Do[If[MatrixRank[Append[b, row]] > Length[b], AppendTo[b, row/row[[Ordering[Abs[row], -1][[1]]]]]], {row, Flatten[Rest[u17mats], 1]}]; b];\nu17r = Length[u17beta]; checks[\"u17 joint site-1 span dim of S2 (Omega1 + ops)\"] = u17r;\nu17extras = Rest[u17beta];\nu17extraTab = Table[{j + 1, rotRank[u17extras[[j]]], Table[rotRank[Ω1 + κ u17extras[[j]]], {κ, {2/3, -5/7, 11/4}}], vacId[u17extras[[j]]]}, {j, Length[u17extras]}];\nu17dec[M_] := Transpose[Table[LinearSolve[Transpose[u17beta], M[[i]]], {i, d1}]];   (* r x 15 *)\nu17Acoef = u17dec /@ u17mats;\nu17cs = Array[u17c, Length[u17mats], 0];\nu17aOfC = Sum[u17cs[[k]] u17Acoef[[k]], {k, Length[u17mats]}];\nu17eqs = DeleteCases[Union[Flatten[Minors[u17aOfC, 2]]], 0];\n{u17solT, u17sol} = AbsoluteTiming[TimeConstrained[Solve[u17eqs == 0, u17cs], 120, $Failed]];\nchecks[\"u17 S2 product locus: # quadrics, # raw Solve components\"] = {Length[u17eqs], If[u17sol === $Failed, $Failed, Length[u17sol]]};\nGrid[{{\"operators of S2\", u17opNames}, {\"joint site-1 span dim\", u17r}, {\"extras: {index, rotRank, rotRank(Ω1+κω) at 3 κ, = Ω_(p,q)?}\", u17extraTab}, {\"# quadrics, Solve time (s), # raw components\", {Length[u17eqs], N[u17solT, 3], If[u17sol === $Failed, $Failed, Length[u17sol]]}}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"vscode-wolfram-message-output\" style=\"color:#f44;border-left:3px solid #f44;background:rgba(255,68,68,0.08);padding:2px 6px;margin:1px 0;border-radius:0 3px 3px 0;font-family:monospace;font-size:0.85em;white-space:pre-wrap\">Solve::svars: Equations may not give solutions for all &quot;solve&quot; variables.</div>",
