  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* classify the raw Solve components of S2. Mt convention: row factor = site-1 covector g1, column factor = site-2 covector g2 (free parameters set to 1). Localizing = site-1 factor parallel to Omega1 (the operator acts on site 2 only); otherwise nontrivial. Also report the dimension of each component (# free parameters) to detect continuous families. *)\nu17factorsOf[sol_] := Module[{cc, free, M, rowi, colj}, cc = u17cs /. sol; free = Variables[cc]; cc = cc /. Thread[free -> 1];\n   M = Sum[cc[[k]] u17mats[[k]], {k, Length[u17mats]}];\n   If[Union[Flatten[M]] === {0}, {\"zero\"}, rowi = First[FirstPosition[Total[Abs[M], {2}], _?(# != 0 &)]]; colj = First[FirstPosition[Total[Abs[M], {1}], _?(# != 0 &)]];\n    {cc, M[[rowi, All]]/M[[rowi, colj]], M[[All, colj]]/M[[rowi, colj]], Length[free]}]];\nu17all = DeleteCases[u17factorsOf /@ u17sol, {\"zero\"}];\nu17locP = Select[u17all, MatrixRank[{#[[2]], Ω1}] == 1 &];\nu17nonP = Select[u17all, MatrixRank[{#[[2]], Ω1}] > 1 &];\nchecks[\"u17 S2 locus: # localizing components (site-1 factor Omega1), # nontrivial components, free params of each\"] = {Length[u17locP], Length[u17nonP], u17locP[[All, 4]], u17nonP[[All, 4]]};\nGrid[{{\"# components: localizing / nontrivial\", {Length[u17locP], Length[u17nonP]}}, {\"# free parameters of the localizing / nontrivial components\", {u17locP[[All, 4]], u17nonP[[All, 4]]}}, {\"c of localizing components on \" <> ToString[u17opNames], Column[u17locP[[All, 1]]]}, {\"c of nontrivial components\", Column[u17nonP[[All, 1]]]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
