       "data": "Out[297]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{ops kept (independent, nonzero)} & \\left\\{\\text{1},\\text{T\\{1, 0\\}@m=1},\\text{T\\{1, 1\\}@m=1},\\text{T\\{2, 0\\}@m=1},\\text{T\\{2, 1\\}@m=1},\\text{T\\{2, 2\\}@m=1},\\text{T\\{3, 0\\}@m=1},\\text{T\\{3, 1\\}@m=1},\\text{T\\{3, 2\\}@m=1},\\text{T\\{3, 3\\}@m=1}\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{site-1 span dim, \\# quadrics, Solve time} & \\left\\{13,7923,120.007389\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{status, \\# raw / localizing / nontrivial} & \\left\\{\\text{timeout},\\mathrm{None}\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
