  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* the full 2x2-minor system (7923 quadrics, 10 unknowns) times out. Rank-1 locus of the linear family M(c) = sum c_k Mt_k via random exact compressions: the 2x2 minors of P.M(c).Q for a few random 3x3 compressions (P: 3x15, Q: 15x3, small integers) are necessary conditions with ~9 quadrics each; every component is then re-verified against the UNcompressed matrix (rank M(c) <= 1 at random values of its free parameters, 3 draws), so spurious compression artefacts are discarded and the verified set is exact; only completeness relies on the compressions being generic (checked by a second independent seed). c = 0 is dropped. *)\nu17locusC[keys_, tmax_, nComp_, seed_] := Module[{full, flat, keep = {}, mats, names, cs, Mc, eqs, sol, t, fOf, all, locP, nonP, ok, rk},\n  full = Join[{{\"1\", Transpose[Partition[Ω2, d1]]}}, Table[{\"T\" <> ToString[k[[1]]] <> \"@m=\" <> ToString[k[[2]]], Transpose[u17M @@ k]}, {k, keys}]];\n  flat = Flatten[Normal[#[[2]]]] & /@ full;\n  Do[If[Union[flat[[i]]] =!= {0} && (keep === {} || MatrixRank[flat[[Append[keep, i]]]] > Length[keep]), AppendTo[keep, i]], {i, Length[full]}];\n  mats = Normal /@ full[[keep, 2]]; names = full[[keep, 1]];\n  cs = Array[u17cc, Length[mats], 0]; Mc = Sum[cs[[k]] mats[[k]], {k, Length[mats]}];\n  SeedRandom[seed]; eqs = DeleteCases[Union[Flatten[Table[Minors[RandomInteger[{-3, 3}, {3, d1}] . Mc . RandomInteger[{-3, 3}, {d1, 3}], 2], {nComp}]]], 0];\n  {t, sol} = AbsoluteTiming[TimeConstrained[Solve[eqs == 0, cs], tmax, $Failed]];\n  If[sol === $Failed, Return[<|\"names\" -> names, \"# ops\" -> Length[mats], \"time\" -> t, \"status\" -> \"timeout\"|>]];\n  fOf[s_] := Module[{cc = cs /. s, free, M, rowi, colj, rks}, free = Variables[cc];\n    rks = Table[MatrixRank[Sum[(cc /. Thread[free -> RandomInteger[{2, 9}, Length[free]]/RandomInteger[{2, 7}, Length[free]]])[[k]] mats[[k]], {k, Length[mats]}]], {3}];\n    cc = cc /. Thread[free -> 1]; M = Sum[cc[[k]] mats[[k]], {k, Length[mats]}];\n    If[Union[Flatten[M]] === {0} || Max[rks] > 1, {\"bad\", Max[rks]}, rowi = First[FirstPosition[Total[Abs[M], {2}], _?(# != 0 &)]]; colj = First[FirstPosition[Total[Abs[M], {1}], _?(# != 0 &)]]; {cc, M[[rowi, All]]/M[[rowi, colj]], M[[All, colj]]/M[[rowi, colj]], Length[free]}]];\n  all = fOf /@ sol; ok = Select[all, #[[1]] =!= \"bad\" &]; locP = Select[ok, MatrixRank[{#[[2]], Ω1}] == 1 &]; nonP = Select[ok, MatrixRank[{#[[2]], Ω1}] > 1 &];\n  <|\"names\" -> names, \"# ops\" -> Length[mats], \"# quadrics\" -> Length[eqs], \"time\" -> t, \"status\" -> \"ok\", \"# raw\" -> Length[sol], \"# discarded (rank > 1 or zero)\" -> Count[all, {\"bad\", _}], \"loc\" -> locP, \"non\" -> nonP|>];\n{u17tH2, u17resH2} = AbsoluteTiming[u17locusC[u17keysH, 120, 4, 11]];\nchecks[\"u17 compressed locus, all shapes at theta2+h: {# ops, # quadrics, status, # raw, # discarded, # localizing, # nontrivial}\"] = If[u17resH2[\"status\"] === \"ok\", {u17resH2[\"# ops\"], u17resH2[\"# quadrics\"], \"ok\", u17resH2[\"# raw\"], u17resH2[\"# discarded (rank > 1 or zero)\"], Length[u17resH2[\"loc\"]], Length[u17resH2[\"non\"]]}, u17resH2[\"status\"]];\nGrid[{{\"ops kept\", u17resH2[\"names\"]}, {\"status, time (s)\", {u17resH2[\"status\"], N[u17resH2[\"time\"], 3]}}, {\"# quadrics / raw / discarded / localizing / nontrivial\", If[u17resH2[\"status\"] === \"ok\", {u17resH2[\"# quadrics\"], u17resH2[\"# raw\"], u17resH2[\"# discarded (rank > 1 or zero)\"], Length[u17resH2[\"loc\"]], Length[u17resH2[\"non\"]]}, None]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
