     "id": "4a533db3-bcf4-497f-ac94-7a75104071c3"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* exact Solve times out for the 19-operator span (all shapes at theta2 and theta2+h). Replacement: Groebner basis over GF(p), p = 1000003, of the 2x2 minors of 12 random 3x3 compressions of M(c) = sum c_k Mt_k (necessary conditions, so V(I) contains the true rank-1 locus). Then for every coefficient c_k test whether c_k^j lies in I for some j <= 12 (PolynomialReduce to 0 mod p): such c_k vanish on the whole locus. The 'free' coefficients are the only ones allowed to be nonzero; if they are exactly the identity and the site-2 local operators (rank 1, site-1 factor Omega1), the locus is the localizing span and there is NO nontrivial product point. A max-independent-set count on the leading monomials gives the affine dimension of V(I). *)\nu17rk = Association[Table[{u17tab[[i, 2]], u17tab[[i, 1]]} -> u17tab[[i, 3]], {i, Length[u17tab]}]];\nu17setR[rmax_, ms_] := Select[Flatten[Table[{l, m}, {m, ms}, {l, shapes}], 1], 1 <= u17rk[#] <= rmax &];\nu17eqsMake[keys_, nComp_, seed_] := Module[{full, flat, keep = {}, mats, names, cs, Mc, eqs},\n  full = Join[{{\"1\", Transpose[Partition[Ω2, d1]]}}, Table[{\"T\" <> ToString[k[[1]]] <> \"@m=\" <> ToString[k[[2]]], Transpose[u17M @@ k]}, {k, keys}]];\n  flat = Flatten[Normal[#[[2]]]] & /@ full;\n  Do[If[Union[flat[[i]]] =!= {0} && (keep === {} || MatrixRank[flat[[Append[keep, i]]]] > Length[keep]), AppendTo[keep, i]], {i, Length[full]}];\n  mats = Normal /@ full[[keep, 2]]; names = full[[keep, 1]];\n  cs = Array[u17cc, Length[mats], 0]; Mc = Sum[cs[[k]] mats[[k]], {k, Length[mats]}];\n  SeedRandom[seed]; eqs = DeleteCases[Union[Flatten[Table[Minors[RandomInteger[{-3, 3}, {3, d1}] . Mc . RandomInteger[{-3, 3}, {d1, 3}], 2], {nComp}]]], 0];\n  <|\"names\" -> names, \"cs\" -> cs, \"eqs\" -> eqs, \"mats\" -> mats|>];\nu17gbTest[keys_, nComp_, seed_, tmax_] := Module[{Q, t, gb, cs, nm, tab, lm, masks, n, best = 0, nonmax},\n  Q = u17eqsMake[keys, nComp, seed]; cs = Q[\"cs\"]; nm = Q[\"names\"]; n = Length[cs];\n  {t, gb} = AbsoluteTiming[TimeConstrained[GroebnerBasis[Q[\"eqs\"], cs, Modulus -> 1000003], tmax, $Failed]];\n  If[gb === $Failed, Return[<|\"status\" -> \"timeout\", \"# ops\" -> n, \"time\" -> t|>]];\n  tab = Table[Module[{j = 1, rem}, While[j <= 12 && (rem = PolynomialReduce[cs[[k]]^j, gb, cs, Modulus -> 1000003, MonomialOrder -> DegreeReverseLexicographic][[2]]; PolynomialMod[rem, 1000003] =!= 0), j++]; {nm[[k]], If[j <= 12, j, \"free\"]}], {k, n}];\n  <|\"status\" -> \"ok\", \"# ops\" -> n, \"# quadrics\" -> Length[Q[\"eqs\"]], \"time\" -> t, \"GB size\" -> Length[gb], \"free\" -> Select[tab, #[[2]] === \"free\" &][[All, 1]], \"max nilpotency order\" -> Max[Cases[tab[[All, 2]], _Integer]], \"names\" -> nm, \"gb\" -> gb, \"cs\" -> cs|>];\nu17gb19 = u17gbTest[u17keys01, 12, 47, 250];\nu17keysR4 = Union[Flatten[Table[u17setR[4, {m}], {m, {-1, 0, 1, 2, -3}}], 1]];\nu17gbR4 = u17gbTest[u17keysR4, 12, 51, 250];\nchecks[\"u17 GF(p) radical test, all shapes at theta2+{0,h} (19 ops): free coefficients\"] = u17gb19[\"free\"];\nchecks[\"u17 GF(p) radical test, rank<=4 ops at m = -1,0,1,2,-3 (13 independent ops): free coefficients\"] = u17gbR4[\"free\"];\n(* the free coefficients must be the identity and site-2 local operators only: check against the rank-1/Omega1-in-span table *)\nchecks[\"u17 free coefficients of the 19-op test are exactly {1} + site-2 local ops\"] = (Sort[u17gb19[\"free\"]] === Sort[{\"1\", \"T{2, 2}@m=0\", \"T{1, 1}@m=1\"}]);\nGrid[{{\"19 ops (all shapes, m = 0, 1): time, GB size, # quadrics, max nilpotency order\", {N[u17gb19[\"time\"], 3], u17gb19[\"GB size\"], u17gb19[\"# quadrics\"], u17gb19[\"max nilpotency order\"]}}, {\"free coefficients\", u17gb19[\"free\"]}, {\"rank<=4 ops at m = -1,0,1,2,-3: # ops, time, free\", {u17gbR4[\"# ops\"], N[u17gbR4[\"time\"], 3], u17gbR4[\"free\"]}}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"607004\" data-output-id=\"113\" data-out-n=\"332\" data-sub-idx=\"12\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"28\" data-sub-start=\"24\" data-sub-end=\"24\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[332]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"22\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.64em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.09em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:3.6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">19 ops (all shapes, m = 0, 1): time, GB size, # quadrics, max nilpotency order</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">free coefficients</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rank&lt;=4 ops at m = -1,0,1,2,-3: # ops, time, free</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:3.6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">111.145075</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">436</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">108</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">T{2, 2}@m=0</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">T{1, 1}@m=1</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">13</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4.081429</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">T{1, 1}@m=-3</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">T{1, 1}@m=-1</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">T{1, 1}@m=0</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">T{1, 1}@m=1</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">T{2, 2}@m=0</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:3.6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[332]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{19 ops (all shapes, m = 0, 1): time, GB size, \\# quadrics, max nilpotency order} & \\left\\{111.145075,436,108,4\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{free coefficients} & \\left\\{\\text{1},\\text{T\\{2, 2\\}@m=0},\\text{T\\{1, 1\\}@m=1}\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{rank<=4 ops at m = -1,0,1,2,-3: \\# ops, time, free} & \\left\\{13,4.081429,\\left\\{\\text{1},\\text{T\\{1, 1\\}@m=-3},\\text{T\\{1, 1\\}@m=-1},\\text{T\\{1, 1\\}@m=0},\\text{T\\{1, 1\\}@m=1},\\text{T\\{2, 2\\}@m=0}\\right\\}\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
