  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* (i) exact Solve on the free coefficients of the rank<=4 test (identity + T11 at m=-3,-1,0,1 + T22 at m=0): only the localizing span survives. (ii) the site-1 span of S2 vs w2: the operators T_lambda(x) are w-independent, so Omega1(w2) -> <Omega|T> is cheap. For each of the six w2: joint site-1 span dim, rotRank of the two extra directions, the pencil Omega1 + kappa omega still a rotation?, torus data {y, d1, d2} of omega (omega is only defined mod Omega1 by the greedy basis, so y(omega) is NOT canonical: the statement is that the whole 2-plane lies in the rotation cone), and the exact product locus of S2 (components localizing / nontrivial). *)\nu17freeKeys = {{{1, 1}, -3}, {{1, 1}, -1}, {{1, 1}, 0}, {{1, 1}, 1}, {{2, 2}, 0}};\nu17rF = u17locusC[u17freeKeys, 100, 4, 61];\nu17S2keys = {{{2, 0}, -1}, {{1, 0}, 0}, {{2, 2}, 0}, {{3, 2}, 0}, {{1, 1}, 1}};\nsolveVacX0[g_, ww_] := Module[{s}, s = Select[Quiet[Solve[Thread[(Om1[zN, {ww[[1]], yv, 1}] . ρdiag[{d1v, d2v, 1}]) == sv g], {yv, d1v, d2v, sv}]], (sv /. #) =!= 0 &]; If[s === {}, \"none\", {yv, d1v, d2v} /. s]];\nu17S2analysis[w2c_] := Module[{ww = {5/2, w2c, 3/5}, O1, O2, mats, beta, Ac, cs, eqs, sol, extras, fo},\n  O1 = Om1[zN, ww]; O2 = kron[O1, O1];\n  mats = Join[{Transpose[Partition[O2, d1]]}, Table[Transpose[Partition[Normal[O2 . u17T[k]], d1]], {k, u17S2keys}]];\n  beta = Module[{b = {O1}}, Do[If[MatrixRank[Append[b, row]] > Length[b], AppendTo[b, row/row[[Ordering[Abs[row], -1][[1]]]]]], {row, Flatten[Rest[mats], 1]}]; b];\n  Ac = Table[Transpose[Table[LinearSolve[Transpose[beta], M[[i]]], {i, d1}]], {M, mats}];\n  cs = Array[u17q, Length[mats], 0]; eqs = DeleteCases[Union[Flatten[Minors[Sum[cs[[k]] Ac[[k]], {k, Length[mats]}], 2]]], 0];\n  sol = TimeConstrained[Solve[eqs == 0, cs], 120, $Failed];\n  fo[s_] := Module[{cc = cs /. s, free, M, rowi}, free = Variables[cc]; cc = cc /. Thread[free -> 1]; M = Sum[cc[[k]] mats[[k]], {k, Length[mats]}]; If[Union[Flatten[M]] === {0}, {\"zero\"}, rowi = First[FirstPosition[Total[Abs[M], {2}], _?(# != 0 &)]]; {cc, M[[rowi, All]]}]];\n  extras = Rest[beta];\n  <|\"r\" -> Length[beta], \"rotRanks\" -> rotRank /@ extras, \"pencil\" -> Table[rotRank[O1 + κ extras[[1]]], {κ, {2/3, -5/7, 11/4}}], \"y,d of omega\" -> solveVacX0[extras[[1]], ww], \"# raw / loc / non\" -> If[sol === $Failed, $Failed, With[{al = DeleteCases[fo /@ sol, {\"zero\"}]}, {Length[sol], Count[al, _?(MatrixRank[{#[[2]], O1}] == 1 &)], Count[al, _?(MatrixRank[{#[[2]], O1}] > 1 &)]}]]|>];\n{u17tS2, u17S2res} = AbsoluteTiming[Association[Table[w2c -> u17S2analysis[w2c], {w2c, u15w2s}]]];\nchecks[\"u17 S2: joint site-1 span dim = 3 and extras rotRank {4, 7}, all six w2\"] = And @@ Table[u17S2res[w2c][\"r\"] == 3 && u17S2res[w2c][\"rotRanks\"] == {4, 7}, {w2c, u15w2s}];\nchecks[\"u17 S2: pencil Omega1 + kappa omega has rotRank 4 (inside the orbit), all six w2\"] = And @@ Table[u17S2res[w2c][\"pencil\"] == {4, 4, 4}, {w2c, u15w2s}];\nchecks[\"u17 S2: product locus = localizing span only (0 nontrivial components), all six w2\"] = And @@ Table[u17S2res[w2c][\"# raw / loc / non\"][[3]] == 0, {w2c, u15w2s}];\nchecks[\"u17 exact Solve on the free set of the rank<=4 test: # localizing, # nontrivial\"] = {Length[u17rF[\"loc\"]], Length[u17rF[\"non\"]]};\nGrid[Join[{{\"w2\", \"site-1 span dim\", \"rotRank of extras\", \"pencil rotRank\", \"{y, d1, d2} of omega (not canonical)\", \"# raw / loc / nontrivial\"}}, Table[{w2c, u17S2res[w2c][\"r\"], u17S2res[w2c][\"rotRanks\"], u17S2res[w2c][\"pencil\"], u17S2res[w2c][\"y,d of omega\"], u17S2res[w2c][\"# raw / loc / non\"]}, {w2c, u15w2s}], {{\"time (s)\", N[u17tS2, 3], \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}, {\"exact Solve on free set of the rank<=4 test: # localizing, # nontrivial\", checks[\"u17 exact Solve on the free set of the rank<=4 test: # localizing, # nontrivial\"], \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
