   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* A2 result: no second product point, hence nothing new to undo; the union with the theta1-3h family is that family alone, so the per-irrep verdict is the one of cell 19. *)\nu17v442 = Select[u15verdictTab, #[[1]] === {4, 4, 2} &][[1]];\nchecks[\"u17 [4,4,2] after A2: HW {dim, rank} at nu - Lambda (unchanged, one family only)\"] = {u17v442[[3]], u17v442[[4]], u17v442[[5]]};\nu17allBool = Flatten[Select[Values[checks], MatchQ[#, True | False | {(True | False) ..}] &]];\nGrid[{{\"site-2 local operators (m, shape), x = theta2 + m h\", checks[\"u17 site-2 local operators (m, shape)\"]}, {\"operators with <Omega|T = 0 (m, shape)\", checks[\"u17 operators with <Ω|T = 0 (m, shape)\"]}, {\"non-local ops of rank <= 2: (m, shape, rank)\", Select[u17tab, 1 <= #[[3]] <= 2 && ! #[[5]] &][[All, {1, 2, 3}]]}, {\"S2 = {1, T20@-1, T10@0, T22@0, T32@0, T11@+1}: joint site-1 span dim; extras rotRank; pencil rotRank\", {3, {4, 7}, {4, 4, 4}}}, {\"S2 exact product locus: # raw components, localizing (site-1 = Ω1), nontrivial\", {2, 2, 0}}, {\"all shapes at theta2+h / theta2 alone (exact, compressed + verified)\", {\"only localizing\", \"only localizing\"}}, {\"all shapes at theta2, theta2+h (19 ops, GF(p) Groebner + radical test): free coefficients\", u17gb19[\"free\"]}, {\"rank<=4 ops at m = -1,0,1,2,-3 (13 independent ops): exact Solve on free set: # localizing, # nontrivial\", checks[\"u17 exact Solve on the free set of the rank<=4 test: # localizing, # nontrivial\"]}, {\"nontrivial product points found\", 0}, {\"[4,4,2] (site weight (1,2,2)): {dim, rank}, fully determined?\", checks[\"u17 [4,4,2] after A2: HW {dim, rank} at nu - Lambda (unchanged, one family only)\"]}, {\"all Boolean checks in `checks` True? (# checks)\", {And @@ u17allBool, Length[u17allBool]}}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
