pes at theta2, theta2+h (19 ops, GF(p) Groebner + radical test): free coefficients} &amp; \\left\\{\\text{1},\\text{T\\{2, 2\\}@m=0},\\text{T\\{1, 1\\}@m=1}\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{rank&lt;=4 ops at m = -1,0,1,2,-3 (13 independent ops): exact Solve on free set: \\# localizing, \\# nontrivial} &amp; \\left\\{1,0\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{nontrivial product points found} &amp; 0\\\\\\hline\\text{[4,4,2] (site weight (1,2,2)): \\{dim, rank\\}, fully determined?} &amp; \\left\\{\\left\\{1,2,2\\right\\},\\left\\{2,1\\right\\},\\mathrm{False}\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{&quot;all Boolean checks in $\\grave{ }$checks$\\grave{ }$ True? (# checks)&quot;} &amp; \\left\\{\\mathrm{True},48\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}</small></span></div></div></div>",
