   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* which reference triple (n1, n21, n22) in Psi_Q = prod_s [Q2(th_s - n21 h) Q3(th_s - n1 h) - Q3(th_s - n21 h) Q2(th_s - n1 h)] Q3(th_s - n22 h) makes <Omega|psi>/<x0|psi> proportional to det6[B, vac]/Psi_Q over the 225 states? Candidates from the task; max |ratio/ratio1 - 1| for each (a few more for reference) *)\nu20triples = {{4, 3, 1}, {4, 2, 1}, {3, 2, 1}, {4, 3, 2}, {4, 2, 0}, {3, 2, 0}, {4, 1, 0}};\nu20ratios = Association[Table[tr -> Table[(ovl[[B]]/x0ovl[[B]])/(det6List[[B]]/psiQg[B, tr]), {B, nSt}], {tr, u20triples}]];\nu20triDev = Table[{tr, sizeQ[constDev[u20ratios[tr]]], N[Min[Abs[Table[psiQg[B, tr], {B, nSt}]]], 3]}, {tr, u20triples}];\nchecks[\"u20: vacuum triple scan (triple, max |ratio/ratio1-1|, min |PsiQ|)\"] = u20triDev;\nGrid[Join[{{\"triple (n1,n21,n22): points th - n h\", \"max |ratio/ratio[1] - 1| over 225 states\", \"min |Psi_Q|\"}}, u20triDev], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
