  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* T_lambda(th1-3h) eigenvalues on the 225 states and the 7-function basis. <Omega|T22 = <Omega|T32 = <Omega|T33 = 0 as covectors, so (with <Omega|psi> != 0 on all states) tau_22, tau_32, tau_33 must vanish identically on the eigenstates; the basis is (1, T10, T11, T20, T21, T30, T31). *)\nTv0N = Association[Table[λ -> N[Tv0[λ], precQ], {λ, shapes}]];\nτSt = Association[Table[λ -> Table[With[{k = Ordering[Abs[vecSt[[B]]], -1][[1]]}, (Tv0N[λ] . vecSt[[B]])[[k]]/vecSt[[B, k]]], {B, nSt}], {λ, shapes}]];\nchecks[\"u20: T_lambda(th1-3h) eigen-residual on the 225 states\"] = sizeQ[Max[Table[Max[Abs[Tv0N[λ] . vecSt[[B]] - τSt[λ][[B]] vecSt[[B]]]], {λ, shapes}, {B, nSt}]]];\nchecks[\"u20: max |tau_22|, |tau_32|, |tau_33| over states (should be ~0)\"] = Table[sizeQ[Max[Abs[τSt[λ]]]], {λ, {{2, 2}, {3, 2}, {3, 3}}}];\nu20shp7 = {{1, 0}, {1, 1}, {2, 0}, {2, 1}, {3, 0}, {3, 1}};\nu20slot = {1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 7, 8};   (* positions of (1,T10,T11,T20,T21,T30,T31) in the 10-slot order (1,T10,T11,T20,T21,T22,T30,T31,T32,T33) of allMats / Acoef / cP *)\nbasisT = Transpose[Join[{ConstantArray[1, nSt]}, Table[τSt[λ], {λ, u20shp7}]]];\nnrmQ[v_] := Sqrt[Total[Abs[Flatten[v]]^2]];\nspanRes[f_, A_] := Module[{cf = LeastSquares[A, f]}, nrmQ[A . cf - f]/nrmQ[f]];\nchecks[\"u20: basis (1,T10,T11,T20,T21,T30,T31): # sv, min/max sv\"] = With[{sv = SingularValueList[basisT, Tolerance -> 0]}, N[{Length[sv], Last[sv]/First[sv]}, 3]];\nconstDev[l_List] := Max[Abs[l/l[[1]] - 1]];\n(* ladder-1 det2 power coefficients over a pole subset P (numerator, not yet divided by a minor): coefficient of y^p = sum_{n+m=p} w_n w_m [Q2(x_n) Q3(x_m - h) - Q3(x_n) Q2(x_m - h)], x_n = th1 - n h, w_n = 1/prod_{m'!=n}(m'-n)h; this is det{{-<Q^j E>, <Q^j[-] E>}}_{j=3,2} with E(x_n) = y^n (as in the [3,1,0] notebook cells 18 and 66) *)\nth1 = thN[[1]];\nu20wg[P_, n_] := N[1/Product[(m - n) hN, {m, DeleteCases[P, n]}], precQ];\nu20numCoefs[P_] := Table[Table[Sum[If[MemberQ[P, p - n], u20wg[P, n] u20wg[P, p - n] (QU[B, 2, th1 - n hN] QU[B, 3, th1 - (p - n) hN - hN] - QU[B, 3, th1 - n hN] QU[B, 2, th1 - (p - n) hN - hN]), 0], {n, P}], {B, nSt}], {p, 0, 2 Max[P]}];\nu20W[B_, {a_, b_}] := QU[B, 2, th1 - a hN] QU[B, 3, th1 - b hN] - QU[B, 3, th1 - a hN] QU[B, 2, th1 - b hN];\nu20num0123 = u20numCoefs[{0, 1, 2, 3}];\n(* minor candidates: the four of the task plus every pair 0 <= a < b <= 5; residual = max over y-powers of the relative least-squares misfit of (y^p coefficient)/W to span{1, tau} *)\nu20minorRes[mp_] := Module[{den = Table[u20W[B, mp], {B, nSt}], cof}, If[Min[Abs[den]] < 10^-30, Return[\"W has a zero\"]]; cof = u20num0123/Table[den, {Length[u20num0123]}]; sizeQ[Max[Table[If[nrmQ[cof[[p]]] < 10^-40, 0, spanRes[cof[[p]], basisT]], {p, Length[cof]}]]]];\nu20pairs = Select[Tuples[Range[0, 5], 2], #[[1]] < #[[2]] &];\n{u20tm, u20minRes} = AbsoluteTiming[Association[Table[mp -> u20minorRes[mp], {mp, u20pairs}]]];\nu20taskPairs = {{3, 4}, {2, 3}, {2, 4}, {3, 5}};\nchecks[\"u20: minor candidates (a,b): span residual of det2^{0..3}[y]/W, symbolic y\"] = Table[{mp, u20minRes[mp]}, {mp, u20taskPairs}];\nu20bestMin = Take[SortBy[Select[Normal[u20minRes], NumberQ[#[[2]]] &], #[[2]] &], 4];\nGrid[Join[{{\"item\", \"value\"}, {\"eigen-residual of T on states\", checks[\"u20: T_lambda(th1-3h) eigen-residual on the 225 states\"]}, {\"max |tau22|,|tau32|,|tau33|\", checks[\"u20: max |tau_22|, |tau_32|, |tau_33| over states (should be ~0)\"]}, {\"basis: # sv, min/max\", checks[\"u20: basis (1,T10,T11,T20,T21,T30,T31): # sv, min/max sv\"]}}, {{\"minor W(a,b)\", \"max span residual\"}}, Table[{mp, N[u20minRes[mp], 3]}, {mp, u20taskPairs}], {{\"best 4 among all pairs 0<=a<b<=5\", N[u20bestMin, 3]}, {\"time (s)\", u20tm}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"607004\" data-output-id=\"178\" data-out-n=\"1155\" data-sub-idx=\"25\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"36\" data-sub-start=\"25\" data-sub-end=\"25\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[1155]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:13.25em;vertical-align:-6.355em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:6.895em;\"><span style=\"top:-8.855em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:8.855em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:13.21em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-6.355em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:6.855em;\"><span style=\"top:-9.015em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">item</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.815em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">eigen-residual of T on states</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.615em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">max |tau22|,|tau32|,|tau33|</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-5.415em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">basis: # sv, min/max</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.215em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">minor W(a,b)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.015em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.815em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.615em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:0.585em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\