   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* pole-subset scan for [3,2,0], minor M = W(3,4) (the only candidate in the previous cell that works). Per subset P: (1) fit of every y-power coefficient of det2^(P)/M to the 7-function basis, (2) exact rational curve cyx(y) on slots (1,T10,T11,T20,T21,T30,T31), (3) exact y with cyx(y) parallel to the product point cP (7 entries of the cell-7 vector), (4) rank of Phi(c(y)) = sum c_k allMats_k at three generic y, (5) all y with Phi(c(y)) of rank <= 1 (gcd of the 2x2 minors of the 2 x 15 decomposition Acoef), each nonzero root classified: Phi != 0, localizing (site-2 factor parallel to Omega1) or not, parallel to cP? *)\nu20subsets = Select[Subsets[Range[0, 3]], Length[#] >= 2 &];\nu20cP7 = cP[[u20slot]];\nu20names = {\"1\", \"T10\", \"T11\", \"T20\", \"T21\", \"T30\", \"T31\"};\nu20gen = {2, -5/3, 7/5};\nu20Phi[cy_, yv_] := Sum[(cy[[i]] /. ySym -> yv) allMats[[u20slot[[i]]]], {i, 7}];\nu20analyze[P_] := Module[{co, dg, cp, resP, rat, cyx, par, supp, ranks, aOf, mins, g, rts, rootInfo, den = Table[minor1B[B], {B, nSt}]},\n  co = Table[v/den, {v, u20numCoefs[P]}]; dg = Length[co] - 1;\n  cp = Table[If[nrmQ[co[[p + 1]]] < 10^-40, ConstantArray[0, 7], LeastSquares[basisT, co[[p + 1]]]], {p, 0, dg}];\n  resP = Table[If[nrmQ[co[[p + 1]]] < 10^-40, 0, nrmQ[basisT . cp[[p + 1]] - co[[p + 1]]]/nrmQ[co[[p + 1]]]], {p, 0, dg}];\n  If[sizeQ[Max[resP]] >= 10^-30, Return[<|\"P\" -> P, \"inSpan\" -> False, \"res\" -> sizeQ[Max[resP]]|>]];\n  rat = Rationalize[Chop[cp, 10^-40], 10^-30]; cyx = Factor /@ (ySym^Range[0, dg] . rat);\n  supp = Pick[u20names, Unitize[cyx /. ySym -> 3], 1];\n  par = Solve[Join[Thread[Flatten[Minors[{cyx, u20cP7}, 2]] == 0], {ySym != 0}], ySym];\n  ranks = Table[MatrixRank[u20Phi[cyx, yv]], {yv, u20gen}];\n  aOf = Sum[cyx[[i]] Acoef[[u20slot[[i]]]], {i, 7}];\n  mins = DeleteCases[Union[Flatten[Expand[Minors[aOf, 2]]]], 0];\n  g = If[mins === {}, 0, PolynomialGCD @@ mins];\n  rts = If[g === 0, \"all y\", If[Exponent[g, ySym] == 0, {}, ySym /. Solve[g == 0, ySym]]];\n  rootInfo = If[rts === \"all y\", {}, Table[If[yr == 0, {yr, \"y=0\"}, With[{M = u20Phi[cyx, yr], cv = cyx /. ySym -> yr}, If[Union[Flatten[M]] === {0}, {yr, \"Phi=0\"}, With[{ri = First[FirstPosition[Total[Abs[M], {2}], _?(# != 0 &)]]}, {yr, MatrixRank[M], If[MatrixRank[{M[[ri]], Ω1}] == 1, \"localizing\", \"non-local\"], MatrixRank[{cv, u20cP7}] == 1}]]]], {yr, rts}]];\n  <|\"P\" -> P, \"inSpan\" -> True, \"res\" -> sizeQ[Max[resP]], \"ratErr\" -> sizeQ[Max[Abs[cp - rat]]], \"cyx\" -> cyx, \"support\" -> supp, \"yDegs\" -> MinMax[Select[Range[0, dg], nrmQ[co[[# + 1]]] > 10^-40 &]], \"yCP\" -> If[par === {}, \"none\", ySym /. par], \"genRanks\" -> ranks, \"rank1roots\" -> rts, \"rootInfo\" -> rootInfo|>];\nminor1B[B_] := u20W[B, {3, 4}];\n{u20tScan, u20res} = AbsoluteTiming[Association[Table[P -> TimeConstrained[u20analyze[P], 120, \"timeout\"], {P, u20subsets}]]];\nchecks[\"u20: pole-subset scan [3,2,0] done (time s)\"] = u20tScan;\nGrid[Join[{{\"P\", \"in span? (res)\", \"support\", \"y-degrees\", \"y hitting c_P\", \"rank Phi at y=2,-5/3,7/5\", \"y with Phi rank<=1: nonzero roots {y, rank, local?, ||cP?}\"}}, Table[With[{r = u20res[P]}, If[r === \"timeout\", {P, \"timeout\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}, If[r[\"inSpan\"], {P, N[r[\"res\"], 2], r[\"support\"], r[\"yDegs\"], r[\"yCP\"], r[\"genRanks\"], If[r[\"rank1roots\"] === \"all y\", \"all y (localizing span)\", DeleteCases[r[\"rootInfo\"], {_, \"y=0\"} | {_, \"Phi=0\"}]]}, {P, {False, N[r[\"res\"], 2]}, \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}]]], {P, u20subsets}], {{\"time (s)\", u20tScan, \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
