   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* end-to-end for the known point: Phi_P = sum_k cP_k <Omega|O_k> (O = 1, T_lambda(th1-3h)), a product covector (rank 1 as a 15x15 matrix, exact). Claim: <Phi_P|psi>/<x0|psi> proportional to det6[B, vac(w1,w2)]/Psi_Q x det2^{0..3}[y-star]/M over the 225 states, with y-star = w2(th12-h)/(th12-3h) = -63/43 and Psi_Q with the vacuum triple (4,3,2) found above. Controls: wrong y, the other triples. *)\nΦP = Flatten[Sum[cP[[k]] allMats[[k]], {k, Length[allMats]}]];\nchecks[\"u20: Phi_P product covector (rank of 15x15, exact)\"] = MatrixRank[Partition[ΦP, d1]];\nyStarP = wN[[2]] (θ12 - hN)/(θ12 - 3 hN);\nu20fy[yy_] := Table[Sum[N[yy, precQ]^(p - 1) u20num0123[[p, B]], {p, Length[u20num0123]}]/u20W[B, {3, 4}], {B, nSt}];\nu20ovP = Table[ΦP . vecSt[[B]], {B, nSt}];\nu20e2e[yy_, tr_] := Table[(u20ovP[[B]]/x0ovl[[B]])/((det6List[[B]]/psiQg[B, tr]) u20fy[yy][[B]]), {B, nSt}];\nu20r432 = u20e2e[yStarP, {4, 3, 2}];\nchecks[\"u20: y-star\"] = yStarP;\nchecks[\"u20: MAIN end-to-end, y-star, triple (4,3,2): max |ratio/ratio1 - 1|\"] = sizeQ[constDev[u20r432]];\nchecks[\"u20: end-to-end with the other triples (4,3,1),(4,2,1),(3,2,1) at y-star\"] = Table[N[constDev[u20e2e[yStarP, tr]], 3], {tr, {{4, 3, 1}, {4, 2, 1}, {3, 2, 1}}}];\nchecks[\"u20: control wrong y = -63/8, 2 with triple (4,3,2)\"] = Table[N[constDev[u20e2e[yy, {4, 3, 2}]], 3], {yy, {-63/8, 2}}];\nchecks[\"u20: ratio constant\"] = N[u20r432[[1]], 12];\n(* the fy curve at y-star equals cP on the 7 live slots up to scale *)\nchecks[\"u20: det2 curve at y-star parallel to cP (7 live entries, exact)\"] = With[{cv = u20res[{0, 1, 2, 3}][\"cyx\"] /. ySym -> yStarP}, MatrixRank[{cv, cP[[u20slot]]}] == 1];\nGrid[{{\"Phi_P rank (1 = product)\", checks[\"u20: Phi_P product covector (rank of 15x15, exact)\"]}, {\"y-star\", yStarP}, {\"MAIN: max |ratio/ratio1 - 1| (225 states), triple (4,3,2)\", checks[\"u20: MAIN end-to-end, y-star, triple (4,3,2): max |ratio/ratio1 - 1|\"]}, {\"other triples (4,3,1),(4,2,1),(3,2,1)\", checks[\"u20: end-to-end with the other triples (4,3,1),(4,2,1),(3,2,1) at y-star\"]}, {\"controls y = -63/8, 2\", checks[\"u20: control wrong y = -63/8, 2 with triple (4,3,2)\"]}, {\"curve parallel to cP at y-star\", checks[\"u20: det2 curve at y-star parallel to cP (7 live entries, exact)\"]}, {\"ratio constant\", checks[\"u20: ratio constant\"]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
