   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* the subsets whose curve has rank-1 Phi for ALL y are inside the localizing span {T11,T21,T31}: check the site-2 factor is parallel to Omega1 at the generic y (trivial product points, not new); P={0,1} is the zero curve *)\nu20allY = Select[u20subsets, u20res[#][\"rank1roots\"] === \"all y\" &];\nu20locChk = Table[{P, u20res[P][\"support\"], Table[With[{M = u20Phi[u20res[P][\"cyx\"], yv]}, If[Union[Flatten[M]] === {0}, \"zero\", With[{ri = First[FirstPosition[Total[Abs[M], {2}], _?(# != 0 &)]]}, {MatrixRank[M], MatrixRank[{M[[ri]], Ω1}]}]]], {yv, u20gen}]}, {P, u20allY}];\nchecks[\"u20: all-y rank-1 subsets: {P, support, {rank, rank{row, Omega1}} at 3 y}\"] = u20locChk;\nchecks[\"u20 A3(ii): [3,2,0] minor W(3,4), vacuum triple (4,3,2); {0..3}->cP at y=-63/43; {0,1,2} curve lies in the localizing span {T11,T21,T31}; no other product covector\"] = True;\nGrid[Join[{{\"P\", \"support\", \"in span? (res)\", \"y-degrees\", \"y hitting c_P\", \"rank Phi at y=2,-5/3,7/5\", \"nonzero y with Phi rank<=1 {y, rank, local?, ||cP}\"}}, Table[With[{r = u20res[P]}, {P, If[r[\"support\"] === {}, \"zero curve\", r[\"support\"]], N[r[\"res\"], 2], r[\"yDegs\"], r[\"yCP\"], r[\"genRanks\"], If[r[\"rank1roots\"] === \"all y\", If[r[\"support\"] === {}, \"zero\", \"all y (support in localizing span)\"], DeleteCases[r[\"rootInfo\"], {_, \"y=0\"} | {_, \"Phi=0\"}]]}], {P, u20subsets}], {{\"all-y subsets: {P, support, {rank, rank{row,Omega1}}}\", u20locChk, \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"}}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
